### Create User | Sign Up
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userType": "Client",
    "email": "client1@outlook.com",
    "password": "pswrd"
}

### Sign In User
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "client1@outlook.com",
    "password": "pswrd"
}

### Sign Out User
Post http://localhost:3000/auth/signout

### Who Am I 
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/whoami

### Update User
