### Get All Users
GET http://localhost:3000/users

### Get User By Id
GET http://localhost:3000/users/2

### Delete User By Id
DELETE http://localhost:3000/users/2

################# Vehicles

### Create Vehicle
POST http://localhost:3000/vehicles/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "licencePlate": "12A 123",
    "vehicleType": "Truck",
    "vehicleSubtype": "Large Box"
}

### Get All Vehicles
GET http://localhost:3000/vehicles/all

### Get All Trucks
GET http://localhost:3000/vehicles/trucks

### Get All Trailers
GET http://localhost:3000/vehicles/trailers

