    "lon": 40,
    "lat": 50
}

### Get All Locations
GET http://localhost:3000/locations/all

################# Carts

### Get All Carts
GET http://localhost:3000/carts/all

### Pay with Credit Card
POST http://localhost:3000/carts/pay?type=creditcard&amount=100

### Pay with Paypal
POST http://localhost:3000/carts/pay?type=paypal&amount=100

################# Reservations

### Add Vehicle to Cart
PATCH http://localhost:3000/reservations/addItem/5

### Remove Vehicule from Cart
